---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Loci" description="Loci privacy policy. Learn how we collect, store, and protect your data.">
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-12">Effective Date: March 25, 2026 &middot; Last Updated: March 25, 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-10 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

        <!-- Introduction -->
        <div>
          <p>
            Loci ("we," "our," or "us") is built by Pearson Media. We believe your location data, voice recordings, and personal notes are deeply private. This policy explains what data we collect, how we store and protect it, and your rights regarding that data.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 font-medium text-brand-700">
            Our core principle: your data stays on your device unless you explicitly choose otherwise.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 1. Data We Collect -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Data We Collect</h2>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Location Data</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li>GPS coordinates when you create a voice note ("locus")</li>
            <li>Reverse-geocoded place names (street address, neighborhood)</li>
            <li>Proximity monitoring regions for notification triggers</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Location data is stored on-device and only synced to our servers if you enable cloud sync (Premium or Family plan).</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Audio Recordings</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li>Voice notes you record, stored as M4A/AAC files</li>
            <li>Audio is encrypted at rest on your device</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Transcriptions</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li>Text transcriptions generated from your voice notes</li>
            <li><strong>All transcription is performed on-device</strong> using Apple's Speech framework — your audio is never sent to external servers for transcription</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Account Information</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li>Apple ID identifier (when using Sign in with Apple)</li>
            <li>Email address (if you choose email sign-in)</li>
            <li>Display name (optional)</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Usage Analytics</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li>Anonymous, aggregated usage events (e.g., feature usage counts)</li>
            <li>No personally identifiable information is included in analytics</li>
            <li>We use <strong>TelemetryDeck</strong>, a privacy-focused analytics provider that does not track individual users</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. How We Store Your Data -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. How We Store Your Data</h2>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">On-Device (Default)</h3>
          <p>By default, all your data — location, audio, and transcriptions — is stored locally on your iPhone using Apple's SwiftData framework. Audio files are encrypted at rest. No account or internet connection is required to use Loci's core features.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Cloud Sync (Optional, Premium &amp; Family Plans)</h3>
          <p>If you subscribe to a Premium or Family plan and enable cloud sync:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>Your loci metadata and transcriptions are synced to our self-hosted <strong>Supabase</strong> backend (PostgreSQL database with PostGIS)</li>
            <li>Audio files are uploaded to encrypted <strong>Supabase Storage</strong></li>
            <li>Data is transmitted over HTTPS with SSL certificate pinning</li>
            <li>Our backend is hosted on dedicated infrastructure (Contabo VPS) managed via Coolify — we do not use shared cloud providers</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Authentication Credentials</h3>
          <p>Auth tokens and session data are stored in your device's <strong>Keychain</strong>, Apple's secure credential storage system.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Data Sharing -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. Data Sharing</h2>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">No Public Data</h3>
          <p>Loci has no social features, public profiles, or discovery mechanisms. Your data is never visible to other users unless you explicitly share it.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">Household Sharing (Family Plan)</h3>
          <p>If you use the Family plan, you can choose to share specific loci with members of your invite-only household group (up to 6 people). Sharing is always opt-in on a per-locus basis. Only household members you have invited can see shared loci.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-5 mb-2">We Never Sell Your Data</h3>
          <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. Period.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Third-Party Services -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>Loci uses the following third-party services:</p>

          <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-sm border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
              <thead>
                <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                  <th class="text-left px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-gray-900">Service</th>
                  <th class="text-left px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-gray-900">Purpose</th>
                  <th class="text-left px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-gray-900">Data Shared</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
                <tr>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Supabase (self-hosted)</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2">Cloud sync, authentication, audio storage</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2">Account info, loci data, audio files (only if sync enabled)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">RevenueCat</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2">Subscription management</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2">Anonymous app user ID, purchase receipts</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">TelemetryDeck</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2">Privacy-focused analytics</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2">Anonymous, aggregated usage signals only</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2 font-medium">Apple (Sign in with Apple)</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2">Authentication</td>
                  <td class="px-4 py-2">Apple ID token (managed by Apple)</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Your Rights & Controls -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Your Rights &amp; Controls</h2>
          <p>You are in control of your data at all times:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li><strong>Access:</strong> All your loci, recordings, and transcriptions are visible to you in the app at any time.</li>
            <li><strong>Export:</strong> You can access your audio files directly on your device.</li>
            <li><strong>Delete individual loci:</strong> Delete any locus from the app. If cloud sync is enabled, the deletion syncs to our servers.</li>
            <li><strong>Delete all data:</strong> Use the Data Management section in Settings to delete all local data. To delete cloud data, contact us and we will remove it within 30 days.</li>
            <li><strong>Delete your account:</strong> Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@useloci.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline">hello@useloci.com</a> to request full account deletion. We will remove all associated data from our servers within 30 days.</li>
            <li><strong>Revoke permissions:</strong> You can revoke location, microphone, notification, or speech recognition permissions at any time in iOS Settings. The app will continue to function with reduced features.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. On-Device Processing -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. On-Device Processing</h2>
          <p>We are committed to processing your data on your device whenever possible:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-3">
            <li><strong>Speech-to-text transcription</strong> uses Apple's on-device Speech framework. Your audio never leaves your device for transcription.</li>
            <li><strong>AI categorization</strong> (Premium) uses on-device processing to suggest categories for your loci.</li>
            <li><strong>Geofence monitoring</strong> is handled entirely by iOS — we do not track your location in the background.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Data Retention -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">7. Data Retention</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>On-device data:</strong> Retained until you delete it or uninstall the app.</li>
            <li><strong>Cloud data:</strong> Retained while your account is active. Deleted within 30 days of account deletion request.</li>
            <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> TelemetryDeck retains anonymous signals for up to 24 months.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 8. Children's Privacy -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>Loci is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us and we will promptly delete it.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 9. Changes to This Policy -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. When we make material changes, we will notify you through the app or by updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page. Your continued use of Loci after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 10. Contact Us -->
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">10. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy or your data, contact us:</p>
          <ul class="list-none pl-0 space-y-1 mt-3">
            <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@useloci.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline">hello@useloci.com</a></li>
            <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="/support" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline">useloci.com/support</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
